&_nc_oc=Adr0hYwbwwryb5Vi288VOJBPvOOTJ287hjCHOz9BOd30iT1XAxY9X00s9QXzgP5i5bk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5mhR0a_pM9hmYRG9hOOxBcy2HbxFjtaBDvDw6D-500Ng&oe=6A1EF123"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Moonbase Bravo", "keywords": ["Multiplayer", "Coop", "online", "shooter", "aliens"], "long_description": "ANSWER THE DISTRESS CALL\n  \n  Remote outposts have gone silent. Alien creatures have overrun the outer colonies and the surviving colonists are running out of time. You are their last option.\n\n  Deploy solo or squad up with up to 3 friends. Navigate infested planetary bases, locate survivors, and fight your way to extraction.\n\n  FEATURES\n  - Solo or co-op multiplayer for 1-4 players\n  - Extraction missions through alien-infested bases\n  - Physical VR weapon handling \u2014 grab, reload, fire\n  - Voice chat for real-time squad coordination \n  - Multiple difficulty levels \u2014 easy to overwhelming\n  - Room-scale VR, optimized for Quest 2 & Quest 3\n\n  THE INFESTATION SPREADS\n  Each mission takes you deeper into infected facilities where alien creatures hunt in the shadows. Every corridor could be your last.\n\n  Actively developed \u2014 new content releasing regularly.\n\n  CAN YOU SECURE THE BASES?\n  Every mission is a fight for survival. Every shadow could be hiding danger.", "short_description": "Alien creatures have overrun the outer colonies. Squad up with up to 3 players and fight your way through infested bases to extract the survivors \u2014 or face the darkness alone."}]}, "developer_name": "Mark Harris", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gist.github.com/Winston-7330/90c5d6ddeb91e04a48d92a6a1b12535a", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mark Harris", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://discord.gg/2Nswuggq9", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "27433